{"format": "rock-editor.scene", "version": 1, "graph": {"nodes": [{"id": 1, "kind": "baseRock", "note": "凸岩峰。頂を走向に沿った稜線にし、節理面（走向 0・傾き 76°）で両側を切って傾いた板にする。Parallel Planes の回転 [0,0,76] と同じ向き。", "baseRock": {"shape": "convexPeak", "size": [9, 15, 7], "seed": 5, "peakSides": 7, "peakTopWidth": 0.06, "peakShoulderHeight": 0.62, "peakLeanX": 0.3, "peakLeanZ": 0.0, "peakVariation": 0.45, "peakRidgeLength": 0.7, "peakStrike": 0, "peakSlabThickness": 0.42, "peakSlabDip": 76}}, {"id": 2, "kind": "scatterPoints", "note": "局所の欠けを作るための90点。輪郭を決めるのは上流の凸岩峰。", "pieces": {"count": 90, "seed": 3, "clustering": 0.9, "clusterScale": 2.0, "heightGradient": 0.4}}, {"id": 19, "kind": "parallelPlanes", "note": "主な節理の系統（76°）。吸着でこの面が通り抜けた一枚の節理面になる", "parallelPlanes": {"rotation": [0, 0, 76], "spacing": 2.4, "variation": 0.8, "seed": 5}}, {"id": 5, "kind": "voronoiFracture", "note": "点の Voronoi を主な節理の面に吸着させて割る（板 ∩ Voronoi）。節理面は複数のブロックにまたがる一枚の面、板の中は不規則な多面体", "pieces": {"rotation": [0, 0, 76], "stretch": [2.5, 1, 1.6], "snap": true}}, {"id": 6, "kind": "pieceSelect", "note": "稜の効き 1。元の外面が 2 方向以上を向く片（稜・角・張り出した縁）だけが先に欠け、面の中央には穴を開けない。", "pieces": {"mode": "peel", "fraction": 0.2, "peelNoise": 1.0, "protectCore": true, "grounded": true, "seed": 3, "peelSize": 0, "stability": 0, "peelRetreat": 0, "peelEdge": 1.0}}, {"id": 7, "kind": "pieceFilter", "note": "選んだブロックを消す", "pieces": {"keep": false}}, {"id": 8, "kind": "piecesToMesh"}, {"id": 9, "kind": "toVolume", "note": "変位なしのピースをボリューム化。接触面由来の細い筋が出る既存の問題は未修正。", "toVolume": {"resolution": 128}}, {"id": 14, "kind": "volumeClip", "note": "裾を8%埋めて接地する。", "volumeClip": {"mode": "ground", "embed": 0.08}}, {"id": 15, "kind": "volumeToMesh", "volumeToMesh": {"method": "dualContouring"}}, {"id": 16, "kind": "meshOutput"}], "links": [{"from": "1", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "5:Geometry"}, {"from": "2", "to": "5:Points"}, {"from": "5", "to": "6"}, {"from": "5", "to": "7:Pieces"}, {"from": "6", "to": "7:Selection"}, {"from": "8", "to": "9"}, {"from": "14", "to": "15"}, {"from": "15", "to": "16:Geometry"}, {"from": "19", "to": "5:Planes"}, {"from": "7", "to": "8"}, {"from": "9", "to": "14"}]}}